Phobos originated as https://github.com/AjayvirS/artemis-phobos, written by
Ajayvir Singh. This repository continues that work: of the commits on `main`,
the large majority are his, and the pruning algorithm, the Bubblewrap
application phase and the netblocker preload library are his design and his
code. Later work in this repository added the CI, the linters and the
repository tooling.

